---
description: Follow the canonical Majesta Two architecture; do not invent parallel designs.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `docs/architecture.md` before adding components, APIs, or workflow states.

Majesta Two is the control plane. DeepSeek Harness owns the model/tool loop. Qwen
stays on the Mac. Do not reimplement the harness inside this repo.

The product subject is this local installation (ADR 0017). It builds the next
version of itself from a worktree and adopts that version only at a process
restart. Do not add a product that develops unrelated repositories. Do not
let the agent loop write the executing tree.

A Mac mini serves the model. This scaffold and DeepSeek Harness run together
on any Mac (ADR 0018). Later device chat uses that model only through the
controller, one inference at a time. Do not give an adapter its own Ollama
client or a second loaded model.

If an implementation would disagree with the spec, stop and add an ADR under
`docs/adrs/` instead of rewriting `docs/architecture.md` to match the code.
